# ─── Pink Binder environment reference ───────────────────────────────────────
#
# We manage secrets in Cloudflare Workers, not in a shared root `.env.local`.
#
# ## Local setup (default)
#
# 1. Set app-specific local values in `apps/<app>/.env.local`.
# 2. Keep deployed values in the matching Cloudflare Worker.
# 3. Restart dev after changing values: `bun dev` or `bun dev:blog`.
#
# Vite/TanStack/Astro apps load `apps/<app>/.env.local` for that app.
# Optional repo-root `.env.local` is still merged by `scripts/with-env.mjs` for
# legacy overrides only — prefer Cloudflare Worker app values going forward.
#
# ─── Shared marketplace keys (usually on landing; duplicate on blog if needed) ─
#
# ETSY_SHOP_ID=
# ETSY_KEYSTRING=
# ETSY_SECRET=
# EBAY_APP_ID=
# EBAY_CLIENT_SECRET=
# EBAY_VERIFICATION_TOKEN=
# EBAY_ACCOUNT_DELETION_ENDPOINT=
# EBAY_DEBUG=1
# WHATNOT_USERNAME=thepinkbinder
# WHATNOT_USER_AGENT=
# WHATNOT_SCRAPE_CACHE_TTL_MS=60000
# LIVE_SHOWS_SOURCE_URL=
# LIVE_SHOWS_SOURCE_TOKEN=
#
# ─── Site URLs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# LANDING_URL=https://pinkbinder.shop
# BLOG_URL=https://pinkbinder.blog
# SHOWS_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=60000
#
# ─── Analytics (per app, client-side) ────────────────────────────────────────
#
# GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=replace-with-search-console-token
#
# ─── Cloudflare R2 (image storage) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Public bucket: pink-binder via https://images.pinkbinder.shop
# For `bun --filter @repo/data run images` publishing to R2:
# Uses wrangler OAuth (no extra token) if CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID is set,
# or S3 API keys if you create them at https://dash.cloudflare.com/?to=/:account/r2/api-tokens
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=e9b73b1b6c312b889732f29b884a5166
# R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# R2_BUCKET=pink-binder
# R2_ACCOUNT_ID=e9b73b1b6c312b889732f29b884a5166
# R2_S3_ENDPOINT=https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
